name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-preassessment-q12_2026-pilot_2026'

question 'Which of the following best describes when data collection by AI is considered harmful?'

wrong 'When a company collects data to improve product recommendations with user permission.'
wrong 'When data is used to train an AI model in a research lab.'
wrong 'When a school collects attendance data to track whether students are present.'
right 'When personal data is collected without a person\'s knowledge and used in ways that could hurt them.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

